        "b": 517.3886800327866
      },
      "content": "Cordset, AC Power, Hospital Grade, Detachable Retainer, AC Power Cord Strap, Velcro, AC Power Cord Terminal, Equipotential Screw, 4-40 x 1/4, Pan Head, Phillips Screw, 6-32 x 5/8, Pan Head, Phillips, with Washer Screw, Jack, 4-40 x 7/16 Washer, Flat, #4",
