    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "txt_0837",
      "reading_order": 911,
      "section": "REPLACEMENT",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 72.00000000000004,
        "t": 486.1258319999997,
        "r": 503.97715200000033,
        "b": 465.23060104918005
      },
      "content": "To replace the AC power cord, retainer, and Velcro strap, see Figure 7-3 ,  then proceed as follows:",
      "hyperlink_hint": true,
      "section_id": "sec_auto_906",
      "parent_section_id": "sec_1",
      "section_level": 2,
      "section_path": [
        {
          "id": "sec_1",
          "title": "1-800-241-4002"
        },
        {
          "id": "sec_auto_906",
          "title": "REPLACEMENT"
        }
      ],
      "page": 96,
      "chunk_hint": "continue",
      "semantic_role": "description",
      "source": "pdf_text"
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0838",
      "reading_order": 912,
      "section": "REPLACEMENT",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 89.58039600000012,
        "t": 450.12640799999974,
        "r": 408.23366399999964,
        "b": 441.23098504918005
      },
      "content": "Turn off the infuser and disconnect the device from AC power.",
      "section_id": "sec_auto_906",
      "parent_section_id": "sec_1",
      "section_level": 2,
      "section_path": [
        {
          "id": "sec_1",
          "title": "1-800-241-4002"
        },
        {
          "id": "sec_auto_906",
          "title": "REPLACEMENT"
        }
      ],
      "page": 96,
      "chunk_hint": "continue",
      "semantic_role": "description",
      "source": "pdf_text"
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0839",
      "reading_order": 913,
      "section": "REPLACEMENT",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 89.58039600000012,
        "t": 434.70633599999974,
        "r": 344.0474400000002,
        "b": 425.81091304918004
      },
      "content": "Remove the battery as described in Section 7.2.4 .",
      "section_id": "sec_auto_906",
      "parent_section_id": "sec_1",
      "section_level": 2,
      "section_path": [
        {
          "id": "sec_1",
          "title": "1-800-241-4002"
        },
        {
          "id": "sec_auto_906",
          "title": "REPLACEMENT"
        }
      ],
      "page": 96,
      "chunk_hint": "continue",
      "semantic_role": "description",
      "source": "pdf_text"
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0840",
      "reading_order": 914,
      "section": "REPLACEMENT",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 89.58039600000018,
        "t": 419.22650399999975,
        "r": 504.03790800000047,
        "b": 410.33108104918006
      },
      "content": "Using the Phillips screwdriver, remove the screws from the AC power cord retainer.",
      "section_id": "sec_auto_906",
      "parent_section_id": "sec_1",
      "section_level": 2,
      "section_path": [
        {
          "id": "sec_1",
          "title": "1-800-241-4002"
        },
        {
          "id": "sec_auto_906",
          "title": "REPLACEMENT"
        }
      ],
      "page": 96,
      "chunk_hint": "continue",
      "semantic_role": "description",
      "source": "pdf_text"
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0841",
      "reading_order": 915,
      "section": "REPLACEMENT",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 89.5803960000002,
        "t": 403.80643199999975,
        "r": 504.0667919999997,
        "b": 383.45103304918007
      },
      "content": "Using  the  10  mm  wrench,  remove  and  inspect  the  equipotential  terminal, and replace, if required.",
      "section_id": "sec_auto_906",
      "parent_section_id": "sec_1",
      "section_level": 2,
      "section_path": [
        {
          "id": "sec_1",
          "title": "1-800-241-4002"
        },
        {
          "id": "sec_auto_906",
          "title": "REPLACEMENT"
        }
      ],
      "page": 96,
      "chunk_hint": "continue",
      "semantic_role": "description",
      "source": "pdf_text"
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0842",
      "reading_order": 916,
      "section": "REPLACEMENT",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 89.5803960000002,
        "t": 376.92638399999976,
        "r": 415.9257719999999,
        "b": 368.03096104918006
      },
      "content": "Unplug the power cord, and slide the plug through the retainer.",
      "section_id": "sec_auto_906",
      "parent_section_id": "sec_1",
      "section_level": 2,
      "section_path": [
        {
          "id": "sec_1",
          "title": "1-800-241-4002"
        },
        {
          "id": "sec_auto_906",
          "title": "REPLACEMENT"
        }
      ],
      "page": 96,
      "chunk_hint": "continue",
      "semantic_role": "description",
      "source": "pdf_text"
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0843",
      "reading_order": 917,
      "section": "REPLACEMENT",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 108.0,
        "t": 364.26,
        "r": 503.9909640000007,
        "b": 335.26752904918027
      },
      "content": " Note: Remove the AC power cord from its receptacle by grasping the plug. Do not pull the cord.",
      "section_id": "sec_auto_906",
      "parent_section_id": "sec_1",
      "section_level": 2,
      "section_path": [
        {
          "id": "sec_1",
          "title": "1-800-241-4002"
        },
        {
          "id": "sec_auto_906",
          "title": "REPLACEMENT"
        }
      ],
      "page": 96,
      "chunk_hint": "continue",
      "semantic_role": "description",
      "source": "pdf_text"
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0844",
      "reading_order": 918,
      "section": "REPLACEMENT",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 89.580264,
        "t": 324.123432,
        "r": 503.9829960000009,
        "b": 303.8277930491803
      },
      "content": "Remove the Velcro strap from the power cord. Inspect the Velcro strap for wear and replace the strap, if required. Attach the strap to the replacement power cord.",
      "section_id": "sec_auto_906",
      "parent_section_id": "sec_1",
      "section_level": 2,
      "section_path": [
        {
          "id": "sec_1",
          "title": "1-800-241-4002"
        },
        {
          "id": "sec_auto_906",
          "title": "REPLACEMENT"
        }
      ],
      "page": 96,
      "chunk_hint": "continue",
      "semantic_role": "description",
      "source": "pdf_text"
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0845",
      "reading_order": 919,
      "section": "REPLACEMENT",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 89.57926799999998,
        "t": 297.243384,
        "r": 475.7762759999998,
        "b": 288.3479610491803
      },
      "content": "Install the replacement AC power cord in the exact reverse order of removal.",
      "section_id": "sec_auto_906",
      "parent_section_id": "sec_1",
      "section_level": 2,
      "section_path": [
        {
          "id": "sec_1",
          "title": "1-800-241-4002"
        },
        {
          "id": "sec_auto_906",
          "title": "REPLACEMENT"
        }
      ],
      "page": 96,
      "chunk_hint": "continue",
      "semantic_role": "description",
      "source": "pdf_text"
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0846",
      "reading_order": 920,
      "section": "REPLACEMENT",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 89.57926800000001,
        "t": 281.823312,
        "r": 384.5177759999995,
        "b": 272.9278890491803
      },
      "content": "Reinstall the battery and connect the device to AC power.",
      "section_id": "sec_auto_906",
      "parent_section_id": "sec_1",
      "section_level": 2,
      "section_path": [
        {
          "id": "sec_1",
          "title": "1-800-241-4002"
        },
        {
          "id": "sec_auto_906",
          "title": "REPLACEMENT"
        }
      ],
      "page": 96,
      "chunk_hint": "continue",
      "semantic_role": "description",
      "source": "pdf_text"
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0847",
      "reading_order": 921,
      "section": "REPLACEMENT",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 89.57926800000001,
        "t": 266.40324,
        "r": 378.7379879999997,
        "b": 257.5078170491803
      },
      "content": "Press the ON/OFF key and verify the infuser powers on.",
      "section_id": "sec_auto_906",
      "parent_section_id": "sec_1",
      "section_level": 2,
      "section_path": [
        {
          "id": "sec_1",
          "title": "1-800-241-4002"
        },
        {
          "id": "sec_auto_906",
          "title": "REPLACEMENT"
        }
      ],
      "page": 96,
      "chunk_hint": "continue",
      "semantic_role": "description",
      "source": "pdf_text"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "txt_0848",
      "reading_order": 922,
      "section": "REPLACEMENT",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 71.998872,
        "t": 242.94345599999997,
        "r": 504.02980799999915,
        "b": 210.04841704918033
      },
      "content": "Replacement of the AC power cord, retainer, and Velcro strap is routine maintenance and no verification procedure is normally required. However, if the infuser may have been damaged during these procedures, perform the PVT in Section 5.2 .",
      "section_id": "sec_auto_906",
      "parent_section_id": "sec_1",
      "section_level": 2,
